NEXT_VALID_TRANSITION:
- obtain an upstream-capable GitHub identity/integration able to perform the required issue comment and fork/branch/PR operations;
- revalidate issue state, bounty availability, and package exact-head applicability before retry;
- mint a receivable only after the upstream claim/PR state actually supports one;
- mint payout only after the upstream payout condition is satisfied and source-verifiable.

